## Findings Identified

| Finding | Severity | Status |
|---------|----------|--------|
| VM-005 – PowerShell Script Block Logging Not Enforced | Medium | Closed |

## Remediation Completed
- Enabled PowerShell Script Block Logging through the **Workstation Hardening - Sprint 10** Group Policy.
- Applied updated Group Policy to WIN11-01.
- Restarted the workstation and validated policy application.
- Confirmed Script Block Logging registry configuration.
- Verified centralized PowerShell logging capability.

