## Challenges Overcome
- Conducted a full vulnerability assessment without relying on automated scanning tools.
- Distinguished true findings from expected enterprise configurations.
- Prioritized findings using a risk-based methodology.
- Safely remediated the only identified security gap through centralized Group Policy.
- Maintained uninterrupted security monitoring throughout assessment and remediation.

## Outcome
Sprint 11 established a repeatable vulnerability management process for the enterprise lab. Assets were inventoried, security configurations were assessed, findings were documented and prioritized, remediation actions were implemented, and validation confirmed the environment remained secure and fully monitored. The lab now includes a documented vulnerability management workflow comparable to those used in enterprise security operations.

